# Secure Healthcare Data Sharing Platform – Implementation Plan

A production-grade, privacy-preserving medical record sharing system with AES-256 encryption, RBAC, MFA, patient consent management, immutable audit logs, and a simple blockchain audit trail.

---

## High-Level System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Client (Next.js + Tailwind)"
        FE[Next.js Frontend<br/>Port 3000]
    end

    subgraph "Docker Network"
        subgraph "Backend (Express)"
            API[Express API Server<br/>Port 4000]
            MW[Middleware Layer<br/>Auth · RBAC · Rate Limit · Consent]
            SVC[Service Layer<br/>Encryption · Blockchain · Audit]
        end

        DB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Port 5432)]
        REDIS[(Redis<br/>Port 6379)]
        STORE[Encrypted File Store<br/>Docker Volume]
    end

    FE -->|REST API| API
    API --> MW --> SVC
    SVC --> DB
    SVC --> REDIS
    SVC --> STORE
```

### Key Security Layers

| Layer | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Transport** | HTTPS-ready, secure headers (helmet) |
| **Auth** | JWT access + refresh tokens, bcrypt passwords |
| **MFA** | TOTP-based OTP via `otplib`, stored in Redis |
| **Authorization** | RBAC middleware (Patient/Doctor/Admin) |
| **Consent** | Patient-controlled access grants with TTL |
| **Encryption** | AES-256-GCM per record, envelope encryption |
| **ABE (Simplified)** | Attribute-based policy checks before decryption |
| **Audit** | Append-only access logs + simple blockchain |
| **Integrity** | SHA-256 hash chain for tamper detection |

---

## Database Schema

```mermaid
erDiagram
    User ||--o{ MedicalRecord : owns
    User ||--o{ Consent : "grants/receives"
    User ||--o{ AccessLog : triggers
    User ||--o{ OtpToken : has
    MedicalRecord ||--o{ AccessLog : "accessed via"
    MedicalRecord ||--o{ Consent : "governed by"

    User {
        uuid id PK
        string email UK
        string passwordHash
        enum role "PATIENT|DOCTOR|ADMIN"
        string name
        json attributes "dept, specialization"
        boolean mfaEnabled
        string mfaSecret
        datetime createdAt
    }

    MedicalRecord {
        uuid id PK
        uuid patientId FK
        string title
        string description
        text encryptedData "AES-256-GCM"
        string encryptionIV
        string encryptionTag
        string encryptedKey "envelope encryption"
        string fileType
        string filePath "encrypted file on disk"
        json abePolicy "required attributes"
        datetime createdAt
    }

    Consent {
        uuid id PK
        uuid patientId FK
        uuid doctorId FK
        uuid recordId FK "nullable = all records"
        enum status "ACTIVE|REVOKED|EXPIRED"
        datetime expiresAt
        datetime createdAt
        datetime revokedAt
    }

    AccessLog {
        uuid id PK
        uuid userId FK
        uuid recordId FK
        string action "VIEW|DOWNLOAD|UPDATE|DELETE"
        string ipAddress
        string userAgent
        string blockchainHash
        datetime timestamp
    }

    OtpToken {
        uuid id PK
        uuid userId FK
        string otp
        datetime expiresAt
        boolean used
    }

    BlockchainBlock {
        int index PK
        string previousHash
        string hash
        json data "log entry summary"
        bigint timestamp
        int nonce
    }
```

---

## API Design

### Auth (`/api/auth`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| POST | `/register` | Register user | Public |
| POST | `/login` | Login (returns JWT or MFA challenge) | Public |
| POST | `/verify-mfa` | Verify OTP and issue tokens | Public |
| POST | `/refresh` | Refresh access token | Refresh token |
| POST | `/setup-mfa` | Enable MFA (returns QR) | JWT |

### Medical Records (`/api/records`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| POST | `/` | Upload & encrypt record | Patient |
| GET | `/my` | List own records | Patient |
| GET | `/:id` | View record (consent check) | Patient/Doctor |
| GET | `/:id/download` | Download decrypted file | Patient/Doctor |
| DELETE | `/:id` | Delete record | Patient |

### Consent (`/api/consents`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| POST | `/` | Grant access to doctor | Patient |
| GET | `/my` | List consents (given or received) | Patient/Doctor |
| PATCH | `/:id/revoke` | Revoke consent | Patient |

### Audit (`/api/audit`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| GET | `/logs` | View access logs | Patient/Admin |
| GET | `/blockchain` | View blockchain | Admin |
| GET | `/blockchain/verify` | Verify chain integrity | Admin |

### Admin (`/api/admin`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| GET | `/users` | List all users | Admin |
| GET | `/dashboard` | Stats and metrics | Admin |

