### Backend

#### [NEW] All backend files
- Express server with helmet, cors, express-rate-limit, express-validator
- Prisma schema matching the ER diagram above
- Service layer for encryption (AES-256-GCM), key management (envelope encryption with master key from env), MFA (TOTP via otplib), blockchain (SHA-256 hash chain), audit logging
- Controller layer with input validation and proper error responses
- Middleware chain: `authenticate → authorize(roles) → checkConsent → controller`

